// HW_CONST 6.05E5, THE CONSTANT FOR BAR/M: EVERY LOSS A HUNDREDFOLD TOO SMALL.  WAS ACCEPTED.
// EXPECT: 2 ERROR
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
OPTION HW_CONST 6.05E5
WATER N1 0 900
SPRINKLER N2 0 -50 80
PIPE P1 N1 N2 100 100
